profile.Learning outcomes and competences:
Upon successful completion of this course, students will be able to: 
- understand to the nature of derivatives, their advantages, and risks;
- work with basic types of financial derivatives traded on OTC markets and on organized exchanges;
- valuate forwards, futures, interest rate swaps, and European options;
- assess and quantify risks of various derivative positions;
- propose hedging and speculation strategies using basic derivative contracts.
